<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n92146" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥάμμα</span></b>  (B), <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ατος</span>,
			τό, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥάπτω</span>)
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>anything sewn</i> or
				<i>stitched, seam, hem</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				85
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hermipp.
				48
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.Com.
				36
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				J.
				<u>AJ</u>
				3.7.5
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>fastening</i> of a bandage <i>by sewing</i> (as <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἅμμα</span> by a knot), <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Off.</u>
				8
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>thread</i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.S.
				1.87
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				<u>Eup.</u>
				1.200
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				<u>UP</u>
				10.12
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b>
			<i>suture</i> of a wound, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Hippiatr.</u>
				71
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
